stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CheckedOut

    CheckedOut --> CheckedIn: checkIn()\nrequires active membership\n(AttendanceController)
    CheckedIn --> CheckedOut: checkOut()

    CheckedIn --> CheckedIn: checkIn() attempted again\n(rejected - "already checked in")

    note right of CheckedIn
        attendance.check_in_time set,
        check_out_time NULL
    end note

    note right of CheckedOut
        Most recent attendance row
        (if any) has check_out_time set
    end note
